#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:72
msgid "Contour: López Polygon-Tracing Algorithm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:74
msgid ""
"`vtkPolyhedron::Contour()` extracts isosurface polygons using the López "
"polygon-tracing method, implemented in `vtkPolyhedronContour`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:79
msgid "**Classify vertices** as inside (scalar > isoValue) or outside."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:81
msgid ""
"**Find iso-vertices** on edges that cross the isosurface. Each iso-vertex "
"lies on an edge shared by exactly two faces. One face sees the edge as "
"outside→inside (the **key face**); the other sees inside→outside."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:85
msgid "**Trace iso-polygons** by walking through key faces:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:86
msgid ""
"start at any unvisited iso-vertex\n"
"repeat:\n"
"    face = current.KeyFace\n"
"    next = next iso-vertex on this face (circular order)\n"
"until next == start\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:94
msgid ""
"The next-iso-vertex-on-key-face rule produces closed polygons that form the "
"isosurface contour without any post-processing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:97
msgid "**Interpolate** positions linearly along the crossing edges."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:99
#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:542
msgid "Key Insight"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../design_documents/PolyhedronAlgorithms.md:101
msgid ""
"Each iso-vertex has a \"key face\" (where the edge goes outside→inside in "
"face traversal order). Tracing through key faces to the next iso-vertex "
"automatically produces closed contour polygons. No triangulation, no edge "
"merging, no fragment assembly."
msgstr ""

