"count vs 439K triangle count reflects that polyhedron iso-polygons are "
"typically quads or pentagons that would otherwise each be split into 2-3 "
"triangles. The 6 MB output size reduction (32%) is meaningful in time-series "
"workflows. With the orientation pass removed, GT=OFF is now strictly faster "
"than GT=ON on this mesh (51 ms vs 59 ms with no normals)."
