msgid ""
"The drone production benchmark (2.88 M cells, 51-73 ms contour, 194 ms clip) "
"sits comfortably within the linear regime of this scaling curve. The 125 M-"
"cell point demonstrates that the algorithm contours nine-figure polyhedral "
"meshes in under one second on commodity hardware."
